01:37:52.339 --> 01:37:53.625
Ayo. Ayo.

01:37:56.779 --> 01:37:58.065
Lihat, kamu ingin melihat?

01:38:00.214 --> 01:38:01.295
Lihat.

01:38:02.873 --> 01:38:03.863
Kau akan melihat.

01:40:02.244 --> 01:40:05.273
<i>Dídac.
